Billable tokens = input, output and cache write tokens of the same tasks.
Cache reads are left out of them: they follow the context a child rereads, not the tier it ran on.
A cheaper tier is not fewer tokens: the figures count tokens that ran, per harness, never summed.
Completed tasks include the failed attempts they redid (respawn in the same session within 10 minutes). Prompt-free.
